\ 1f.0f
\ stage 1 of mf - macro-expansion based assembler
\ %moveax $b8 ; - define macro moveax to expand to $b8
\ macros are 'late binding' - stored as text, parsed when invoked
\ :label defines a label. currently using a defined label does nothing
\ can use & to generate the address for it. can forward reference for this.
\ unfulfilled forward references are replaced with dead beef.
\ !size inserts the size of the program when complete.
\ four data structures are needed for this program:
\ input buffer, output buffer, dictionary, correction buffer

:main
    read-stdin \ read program
    while word parse end
    correct
    writeout
    exit
